3.2 Research Questions
3.2.1 RQ1: Effectiveness of MARTENS in revealing ARM failures. Motivation. We aim to ensure that the designed in-simulation testing method is able to reveal system failures. Our goal is also to determine whether evolutionary search (GA) can reveal more diverse and numerous failures than random search (RS). Method. For both use cases, we perform five runs of RS and GA with 220 evaluations each. Then, we compute the number of passed versus failed test cases, as well as the near-failed test cases. To distinguish the failure involving DNN prediction inaccuracy and


